      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yafuatayo ni maeneo ya nchi ambayo walipewa Waisraeli katika nchi ya Kanaani. Kuhani Eleazari na Yoshua, mwana wa Nuni, pamoja na wakuu wa koo za makabila ya Waisraeli waliwagawia Waisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 26:52-56; 34:13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sehemu yao hiyo waligawiwa kwa kura kama vile Mwenyezi-Mungu alivyomwamuru Mose awape yale makabila tisa na nusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 32:33; 34:14-15; Kumb 3:12-17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mose alikuwa ameyapa yale makabila mawili na nusu sehemu yao mashariki ya Yordani, lakini Walawi hawakuwa wamepewa sehemu yao pamoja nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazawa wa Yosefu walikuwa makabila mawili: Manase na Efraimu. Kabila la Lawi halikupewa sehemu yoyote ya nchi, ila miji tu ya kuishi na sehemu za malisho kwa ajili ya wanyama wao na riziki zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Waisraeli wakaigawanya nchi kama vile Mwenyezi-Mungu alivyomwamuru Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
