        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 14:30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Siku moja watu wa kabila la Yuda walimwendea Yoshua huko Gilgali. Kalebu mwana wa Yefune, ambaye alikuwa Mkenizi, akamwambia Yoshua, “Bila shaka unakumbuka jinsi Mwenyezi-Mungu alivyomwambia Mose, mtu wa Mungu, juu yangu na wewe tulipokuwa Kadesh-barnea: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 13:1-30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nilipokuwa na umri wa miaka arubaini, Mose mtumishi wa Mungu, alinituma kutoka Kadesh-barnea, kwenda kuipeleleza nchi. Niliporudi nilimletea habari za mambo ya huko kadiri nilivyoamini moyoni mwangu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hali wale wenzangu waliokwenda pamoja nami waliwavunja watu moyo, lakini mimi nilimfuata Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wangu, kwa uaminifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 14:24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Siku hiyo Mose aliniapia, ‘Hakika sehemu ya nchi ile ambayo ulipita itakuwa yako wewe na wazawa wako milele. Kwa sababu ya uaminifu wako kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini sasa tazama! Ni muda wa miaka arubaini na mitano tangu Mwenyezi-Mungu alipoongea na Mose, wakati Waisraeli walipokuwa wanapitia jangwani. Tangu wakati huo Mwenyezi-Mungu, kama alivyoahidi, amenihifadhi hai mpaka leo, na sasa mimi nina umri wa miaka themanini na mitano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini bado nina nguvu kama nilivyokuwa wakati ule Mose aliponituma. Hata sasa nina nguvu za kuweza kupigana vita au kufanya kazi nyingine yoyote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa naomba unipe nchi hii ya milima ambayo Mwenyezi-Mungu aliniahidi siku ile. Wewe ulisikia siku ile kwamba Waanaki waliishi humo katika miji yenye ngome; huenda Mwenyezi-Mungu atakuwa pamoja nami, nami nitawafukuza kama Mwenyezi-Mungu alivyosema.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Yoshua akambariki Kalebu mwana wa Yefune na kumpa mji wa Hebroni kuwa sehemu yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, mji wa Hebroni ni sehemu yao wazawa wa Kalebu mwana wa Yefune Mkenizi mpaka hivi leo, kwa sababu Kalebu alikuwa mwaminifu kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mji wa Hebroni hapo awali uliitwa Kiriath-arba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kiriath-arba:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maana yake mji wa Arba.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Arba alikuwa mtu maarufu kuliko wote kati ya Waanaki. Nchi nzima ikawa tulivu bila vita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
